(7,'[\"Identify common injection entry points in web applications\",\"Craft and test injection payloads relevant to XML Processing Security Scenario\",\"Retrieve or manipulate data through successful exploitation\",\"Understand mitigation techniques and secure coding practices\"]','[\"You have been brought in as a security consultant for a mid-sized e-commerce platform.\",\"The development team uses a backend that is vulnerable to XML Processing Security Scenario.\",\"During initial recon you notice that several input fields are passed directly to the backend without sanitization.\",\"Your objective is to exploit the vulnerability, extract the hidden flag, and document the impact.\"]','[\"Try injecting special characters into every input field.\",\"Think about how the server constructs its query — what happens with a single quote or operator?\",\"Burp Suite or a browser proxy will help you intercept and modify requests.\"]','[{\"sub\":\"owasp.org\",\"href\":\"https://owasp.org/www-community/Injection_Flaws\",\"title\":\"OWASP – Injection\"},{\"sub\":\"cheatsheetseries.owasp.org\",\"href\":\"https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/SQL_Injection_Prevention_Cheat_Sheet.html\",\"title\":\"OWASP SQL Injection Prevention Cheat Sheet\"},{\"sub\":\"portswigger.net\",\"href\":\"https://portswigger.net/web-security/sql-injection\",\"title\":\"PortSwigger – Injection\"}]'),
(8,'[\"Identify weaknesses in the authentication flow related to Authentication Bypass Scenario\",\"Bypass or abuse authentication and session controls\",\"Understand token and session lifecycle risks\",\"Recognize and apply secure authentication patterns\"]','[\"A startup has launched a SaaS application and suspects their login system has critical weaknesses.\",\"The application is vulnerable to Authentication Bypass Scenario.\",\"They have asked you to assess the authentication flow from credential submission to session management.\",\"Your goal is to bypass or abuse the mechanism and retrieve the hidden flag.\"]','[\"Inspect the login request and response closely in your proxy.\",\"Look at how tokens are generated — are they predictable or reusable?\",\"Check what happens if you modify the session token or JWT claims.\"]','[{\"sub\":\"cheatsheetseries.owasp.org\",\"href\":\"https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Authentication_Cheat_Sheet.html\",\"title\":\"OWASP Authentication Cheat Sheet\"},{\"sub\":\"cheatsheetseries.owasp.org\",\"href\":\"https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Session_Management_Cheat_Sheet.html\",\"title\":\"OWASP Session Management Cheat Sheet\"},{\"sub\":\"portswigger.net\",\"href\":\"https://portswigger.net/web-security/authentication\",\"title\":\"PortSwigger – Authentication\"}]'),
